+
+> This curated list of the best AI tools for insurance agents in 2026 focuses on open source software with public GitHub repositories only. It emphasizes practical agency use cases like policy document intake, quote knowledge search, call automation, workflow orchestration, and private AI infrastructure that can be self-hosted for compliance-sensitive insurance operations.
+
+## Table of Contents
