+
+---
+
+#### [MarkItDown](https://github.com/microsoft/markitdown)
+> **Description:** MarkItDown converts files and office documents into Markdown, which makes downstream LLM workflows substantially easier. The README calls out support for common office formats, binary stream conversion, optional feature groups, CLI usage, and integration with LLM applications through MCP. Insurance agencies can use it to normalize carrier guides, rate manuals, training documents, and email attachments into a format that is far easier to index in a knowledge base or pass through retrieval and summarization pipelines.
+
