+> **Description:** RAGFlow presents itself as a full Retrieval-Augmented Generation engine that combines advanced retrieval with agent capabilities. The README emphasizes document understanding, citation-aware answers, workflow support, and a strong context layer for LLM applications. For insurance agencies, it fits the common need to answer producer and CSR questions from policy manuals, endorsements, carrier appetites, playbooks, and service procedures while keeping source references visible for auditability and reducing hallucination risk in customer-facing workflows.
